# File structure rule
- src/handlers/* has all the lambda function handlers
- src/repository/* has the files for each service, each file here will have code for database. [dynamoDbRepo.ts](mdc:src/repository/dynamoDbRepo.ts) is parent to other files in the folder.
- src/services/* has all the business logics for each module

# Error handling rules
- Always use custom error classes [errors.ts](mdc:src/utils/errors.ts) at the places possible
- Custom error classes will handled in [requestHandler.ts](mdc:src/utils/requestHandler.ts)
- Custom errors thrown should not be return in the response, it should be overriden by a clean text hiding sensitive data in [requestHandler.ts](mdc:src/utils/requestHandler.ts)
- Prefer not to use try catch, we will try to handle error in parent call using .catch() from promise response.

# Response Structure
- in src/handlers/* , mainHandler should not return APIGatewayProxyResult structure response. 
- in src/handlers/* , mainHandler can return with anything.
- @requestHandler.ts should handle the returned information from mainHandler to structure for APIGatewayProxyResult

# Comments
- Only add necessary comments
- Don't add comments related to current changes.